 the exact mappings below:\\n\\n| Exit | Directory codes |\\n| ---: | --- |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1080,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 270,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
