{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ccb1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b051-fe1f-7003-b3e2-8d6f1f519698"},"sequence":1203,"recorded_at":1780531400002401,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e6cba34f-41b8-4fac-9aa3-0e4eec26db87","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e6cba34f-41b8-4fac-9aa3-0e4eec26db87","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e6cba34f-41b8-4fac-9aa3-0e4eec26db87"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b070-90c7-7643-98b2-48cecb190c93"},"task_id":"01a0b070-90c7-7643-98b2-48cecb190c93","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b070-90c7-7643-98b2-48cecb190c93","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: line 75\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-- SESSQUERY-STATUS-PLACEHOLDER\n+- Rev1 CR validation failure (command 5/27 `go test ./... -race -count=1`):\n+  `internal/sessquery` hit the default 10m per-package timeout (600.336s) while the\n+  full suite ran in parallel. Root-caused as load-dependent and independent of this\n+  leaf: (a) `go list -deps -test ./internal/sessquery/` contains meshneg 0 times —\n+  the candidate is not even linked into that binary; (b) meshneg has no `init()`,\n+  no I/O, no shared mutable state; (c) machine load during the reruns was 20–42 on\n+  16 CPUs (shared box). Standalone `go test ./internal/sessquery/ -race -count=1`\n+  (default timeout) also timed out at 600.421s under that load; with\n+  `-timeout 20m` and no competing load from this run it PASSED green, exit 0,\n+  617.983s, no test failures and no race reports (log in the tar). Verdict:\n+  timeout-only, pre-existing, no leaf defect; no sessquery file touched (outside\n+  the story boundary). The CR validation suite reruns automatically on handoff.\n","final_result":true}}}
